              "html": "<p>Обо­зна­чая <span data-inline-latex=\"t=\\log_5 (25-x^{2})\"></span> , по­лу­ча­ем квад­рат­ное не­ра­вен­ство <span data-inline-latex=\"t^{2}-3t+2\\ge 0\"></span>, от­ку­да <span data-inline-latex=\"t\\le 1\"></span> или <span data-inline-latex=\"t\\ge 2\"></span>. Тогда имеем:</p><center><p><span> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\left[\\begin{aligned}\\log_5 (25-x^{2})\\le 1\\\\\\log_5 (25-x^{2})\\ge 2\\end{aligned}\\right..\\quad \\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}0\\lt 25-x^{2}\\le 5{,}25-x^{2}\\ge 25\\end{aligned}\\right..\\quad \\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}20\\le x^{2}\\lt 25\\\\x^{2}\\le 0\\end{aligned}\\right..\\quad \\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}-5\\lt x\\le -\\sqrt{20}\\\\\\sqrt{20}\\le x\\lt 5\\\\x=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\"></span> . </span></p></center>",
