          },
          {
            "at": "2026-10-01T22:17:10.104409+00:00",
            "by": {
              "type": "pipeline",
              "stage": "deterministic_svg"
            },
            "value": {
              "html": "<p>Най­дем ОДЗ: 4 + 3<i>x</i> − <i>x</i><sup>2</sup> &gt; 0 ⇔ <i>x</i><sup>2</sup> − 3<i>x</i> − 4 &lt; 0 ⇔ (<i>x</i> − 4)(<i>x</i> + 1)&lt;0 ⇔ −1&lt; <i>x</i> &lt; 4.</p><center><p><span> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\log_2^{2} (4+3x-x^{2})+7\\log_{(0{,}5)} (4+3x-x^{2})+10\\gt 0\\iff \\log_2^{2} (4+3x-x^{2})-7\\log_2 (4+3x-x^{2})+10\\gt 0\"></span>.</span></p></center><p>Пусть  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\log_2 (4+3x-x^{2})=t\"></span>, тогда <span data-inline-latex=\"t^{2}-7t+10\\gt 0\\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}t\\gt 5\\\\t\\lt 2\\end{aligned}\\right.\"></span> . </p><p>Пе­ре­хо­дим к пе­ре­мен­ной <i>x</i>:</p><center><p><span><span data-inline-latex=\"\\left[\\begin{aligned}\\log_{2}(4+3x-x^{2})&amp;&gt;5,\\\\\\log_{2}(4+3x-x^{2})&amp;&lt;2\\quad\\text{ОДЗ}\\end{aligned}\\right.\\Leftrightarrow\\left[\\begin{aligned}4+3x-x^{2}&amp;&gt;32,\\\\4+3x-x^{2}&amp;&lt;4\\end{aligned}\\right.\\Leftrightarrow\\left[\\begin{aligned}x^{2}-3x+28&amp;&lt;0,\\\\x^{2}-3x&amp;&gt;0\\end{aligned}\\right.\\Leftrightarrow x^{2}-3x&gt;0\\Leftrightarrow\\left[\\begin{aligned}x&amp;&gt;3,\\\\x&amp;&lt;0\\end{aligned}\\right.\"></span></span></p></center><p>Не­ра­вен­ство <span data-inline-latex=\"x^{2}-3x+28\\lt 0\"></span>  — ре­ше­ний не имеет, т. к. <span data-inline-latex=\"x^{2}-3x+28\\gt 0\"></span>.</p><p>Учи­ты­вая ОДЗ, по­лу­ча­ем:</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\begin{cases}-1\\lt x\\lt 4\\\\\\left[\\begin{aligned}x\\gt 3\\\\x\\lt 0\\end{aligned}\\right.\\end{cases}.\\quad \\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}-1\\lt x\\lt 0\\\\3\\lt x\\lt 4\\end{aligned}\\right.\"></span> .  или <span data-inline-latex=\"x\\in (-1;0)\\cup (3;4)\"></span> .</p></center>",
              "title": "Решение",
              "asset_keys": []
            },
            "operation": "rewrite",
            "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"
          },
