            "value": {
              "html": "<p>Опре­де­лим об­ласть до­пу­сти­мых зна­че­ний: <span data-inline-latex=\"x+4{,}2\\gt 0\\iff x\\gt -4{,}2\"></span>.</p><p>Про­из­ведём за­ме­ну:  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\log_2 (x+4{,}2)=t\"></span>, по­лу­чим не­ра­вен­ство  <span data-inline-latex=\"(t+2)(t-3)\\ge 0\"></span>, от­ку­да <i>t</i> ≤ −2 или <i>t</i> ≥ 3. Со­от­вет­ствен­но</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\log_2 (x+4{,}2)\\le -2\"></span> или  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\log_2 (x+4{,}2)\\ge 3\"></span>.</p></center><p>Решим по­лу­чен­ные не­ра­вен­ства:</p><center><p><span> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\left[\\begin{aligned}\\log_2 (x+4{,}2)\\le \\log_2 0{,}25\\\\\\log_2 (x+4{,}2)\\ge \\log_2 8\\end{aligned}\\right..\\quad \\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}0\\lt x+4{,}2\\le 0{,}25\\\\x+4{,}2\\ge 8\\end{aligned}\\right..\\quad \\iff\"></span> <br/> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}-4{,}2\\lt x\\le -3{,}95\\\\x\\ge 3{,}8\\end{aligned}\\right..\\quad \\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}x\\in (-4{,}2;-3{,}95]\\\\x\\in [3{,}8;+\\infty)\\end{aligned}\\right.\"></span> . </span></p></center><p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"0f841f8d-342c-42d4-bca5-3c6c79713091\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\"/></p>",
