              "type": "pipeline",
              "stage": "deterministic_svg"
            },
            "value": {
              "html": "<p>Пусть <span data-inline-latex=\"t=\\log_2 (16+6x-x^{2})\"></span> , тогда не­ра­вен­ство при­мет вид:</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"t^{2}-10t+24\\gt 0\\iff (t-4)(t-6)\\gt 0\\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}t\\lt 4\\\\t\\gt 6\\end{aligned}\\right.\"></span> .</p></center><p>При <span data-inline-latex=\"t\\lt 4\"></span> по­лу­чим: </p><center><p><span> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\log_2 (16+6x-x^{2})\\lt 4\\iff 0\\lt 16+6x-x^{2}\\lt 16\\iff\"></span> <br/> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\iff 0\\lt x^{2}-6x\\lt 16\\iff \\begin{cases}x^{2}-6x\\gt 0x^{2}-6x-16\\lt 0\\end{cases}.\\quad \\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}-2\\lt x\\lt 0\\\\6\\lt x\\lt 8\\end{aligned}\\right.\"></span> .</span></p></center><p>При <span data-inline-latex=\"t\\gt 6\"></span> по­лу­чим:</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\log_2 (16+6x-x^{2})\\gt 6\\iff 16+6x-x^{2}\\gt 64\\iff x^{2}-6x+48\\lt 0\"></span>.</p></center>По­след­нее не­ра­вен­ство ре­ше­ний не имеет.<p>Ре­ше­ние ис­ход­но­го не­ра­вен­ства:  <span data-inline-latex=\"-2\\lt x\\lt 0{,}6\\lt x\\lt 8\"></span>.</p>",
